OL,3,GNEWSATraders losing thousands over city
OL,4,Acentre roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndependent business owners in
OL,7,FBirmingham city centre say they are
OL,8,Flosing thousands of pounds every week
OL,9,Fdue to ongoing works to improve the
OL,10,Ffootpaths.
OL,12,FIt is part of a two-year project that
OL,13,Fstarted in January to improve areas
OL,14,Facross the city, including re-paving
OL,15,Fpaths and upgrading street lighting.
OL,17,FDavid Sturgeon, founder of Shepherds
OL,18,Fbarbershop, said since the work started
OL,19,Fin-front of his salon in Piccadilly
OL,20,FArcade on New Street, he has lost about
OL,21,F#12,000 in trade, compared to the
OL,22,Fprevious month.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
