OL,3,GNEWSATraders losing thousands over city
OL,4,Acentre roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city council said it had worked to
OL,7,Fkeep the city open for business but
OL,8,Fadded any reduction in footfall did not
OL,9,Fentitle traders to compensation.
